  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Leno",
      "content": "A less sci-fi version of \"get out\", the movie follows an ex-convict former military who goes to a small town in Ohio after his family, only to find the town crowded with white supremacists who harvest organs from the black folk. The idea was great but the execution subpar. The movie tried to hard to be iconic and a few dialogs are just ridiculous. Overall an entertaining movie but be prepared to cringe in a few scenes. The ending was also very disappointing.",
      "rating": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28T04:31:19Z"
    }
